mindmap
  root((Momentum Trading Rules))
    Fundamentals
      EPS growth >= 20-25%
      Sales growth >= 15-20%
      ROE >= 15%
      Low debt
      Sector leadership
    Technical
      Trend Template
        Price > SMA50 > SMA150 > SMA200
        Within 25% of 52w high
        30%+ above 52w low
        RS top 20-30%
      Volume
        Breakout >= 1.5x avg vol
      VCP
        Shrinking pullbacks
      ATR Stop
        Entry - 1.5-2x ATR
    News Catalyst
      Fresh <= 48h
      High/Medium impact
      Price confirms materiality
      Gap >= 3% priority
    Risk Management
      Risk 1-2% per trade
      Max 8-10% position
      Trail at +1R
      Track in R-multiples
    Options
      Check IV percentile
      30-45+ DTE preferred
      Delta 0.6-0.7 for stock sub
      Max loss = premium
